      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry to be pedantic but 3 significant digits wouldn\u0027t tell us where the decimal point would go, i.e. why would 111 not be 1.11% or 0.00111%\nBased on your example, I think it means `thousandths`.\nMaybe rounded to integer is fine (despite my previous comment) or simply a `float`?",
