      "writtenOn": "2023-01-04T17:50:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "of course it\u0027s an int :) But we need to say what it represents. Float doesn\u0027t make sense here - it\u0027s always x.x%, no more than one digit after the decimal point\n\nTenths_of_a_percent? Thousandths_of_build?",
