      "writtenOn": "2023-01-04T18:37:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is going to be stored in the metrics pipeline, under CL info. We haven\u0027t used it anywhere yet because we need the proto in order to serialize :) \n\nA standard bazel profile output looks something like this: https://paste.googleplex.com/5962385708810240\n\nWhich made me realize that thousandths isn\u0027t good enough. Still, I think using a float is overkill when we know the number of digits and can format properly.",
